		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=5212&amp;p=37713#p37713"><![CDATA[
Its very strange that this is only occuring on one repeater.<br><br>Have you tried manually setting up the VFO for use with the same repeater?<br>i.e Don't copy the channel to the VFO... Manually enter the Tx and Rx freqs and don't change anything else, except what is necessary e.g. set a CTCSS tone.<br><br>I'm wondering if somehow the tone you are hearing is related to the CTCSS tone freq e.g. a harmonic ???<br><br><br>If the tone was on all FM Tx, its possibly the backlight dimming PWM.  But as you say this is not on Simplex etc, I doubt its the PWM, as that would apply to all FM transmissions<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Mon Jul 14, 2025 4:45 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
